      "content": "hey quick question... i was just diagnosed w/ hyperthyroidism (my doctors say my levels are a bit high) but i also take adderall for adhd. lately when i take my meds i feel super jittery and my heart feels like it's racing a lot. is it okay to keep taking my regular dose or should i be worried about them interacting?",
