      "content": "i know i should call them but they r so hard to get a hold of and i have a huge exam coming up this week. i really need the focus. if i just take something to calm my heart down like a beta blocker or just maybe a slightly lower dose of the adderall would that be safe enough to get through the week? i just dont want to deal with the heart racing part.",
