    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get what u say about the doctor but like... everyone says the jitters are just a side effect and nothing serious. my heart races but it doesn't actually hurt, it just feels fast. if i just take half my dose for the next few days until the exam is over, it shouldn't be a big deal right? i just need to be able to study without feeling like i'm shaking constantly. is there any reason why cutting the dose in half would be actually dangerous?",
